[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5267522259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122336#issuecomment-5267522259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122336","id":5267522259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOfgC0w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T13:33:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T13:33:46Z","body":"A warning might help here to clarify the documented behavior indeed","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5267522259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6294530271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122336#issuecomment-6294530271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122336","id":6294530271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdy7o3w","user":{"login":"VanchiNathanTM","id":63664356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjY0MzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63664356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM","html_url":"https://github.com/VanchiNathanTM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T15:28:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:28:27Z","body":"Hi! I'd like to work on this.\n\nI would add a new GDScript warning, `EXPORT_IN_INNER_CLASS`, raised by the analyzer when an `@export*` annotation is used on a variable inside an inner class. The message would say the property won't be exported because exports only work in the script's main class. I'll add a test under `modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/analyzer/warnings/`.\n\nIt would be a warning(rather than an error)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6294530271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6295744622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122336#issuecomment-6295744622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122336","id":6295744622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABd0Fwbg","user":{"login":"VanchiNathanTM","id":63664356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjY0MzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63664356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM","html_url":"https://github.com/VanchiNathanTM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanchiNathanTM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T16:25:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:25:14Z","body":"I prototyped the warning (raised in the analyzer when an `@export*` variable is declared in a class that has an `outer`), and it turned out to be too broad.\n\nRunning the GDScript tests with it enabled, `modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/runtime/features/duplicate_resource.gd` now triggers it. That test declares an inner class `TestResource extends Resource` with `@export` variables, and `duplicate()` does copy those properties. So `@export` in an inner class does not always have no effect, at least for Resource subclasses.\n\nWhich one of these is the intended behavior?\n1. Warn on every `@export` in an inner class (and add `@warning_ignore` to that existing test)\n2. Warn only when the inner class cannot make use of it (for example, not for classes that extend `Resource`)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6295744622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]